<title>USA: Somerset County, N.J., won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Somerset County, N.J., won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $17.299 million of Somer set County, N.J., various general obligation bonds, with a lowest rate of 5.70.</p>
